{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/1bea0a81b180e7c3e943a43f416565ca.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=374 /></span><br><br>Garden Apocalypse is an Action/RPG with Tower Defense and Gardening elements. This epic adventure takes place on a strange alien desert world called &quot;Gardenia&quot;, fighting for resources and survival against a relentless army of mutant insects called The Swarm. Build structures, mine resources, and craft essential ammunition and magic potions required to conquer the Swarm Queen and restore balance to a dying world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/f07af6c3156397019377657e77a68775.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=351 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/8b2411fa60fac98fb2a4cb5738b9a28a.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=685 /></span>Choose from a wide variety of ranged and melee weapons to fight The Swarm and defend your crops. Enemies will drop key resources, depending on the weapon used to defeat them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/a86a33b8e8edfb38448fae2d7cb0f069.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=477 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardenians are your allies, who act as stationary defense towers. Destroy Swarm eggs before they hatch to acquire Swarm Stem Cells - a necessary component in crafting Gardenian seeds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/9cd53c4a5268e56f23b29537453add79.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft seeds by mining or crafting essential minerals. Once harvested, your crops can be used to replenish health or crafted into magic potions, required for casting spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/9995a0153f592f8f48f0e3dad440f77c.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=414 /></span>Magic spells are crucial to counter massive Swarm armies and unlock new areas as the player progresses. Only magic can defeat the &quot;Swarm Queens&quot;, making gardening an essential activity to craft potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/3e422b0fd06cd0f48be65d70f2a9f0d1.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic is required to unlock and reactivate several ancient temples across the world. These dungeons are full of large swarms, puzzles, loot and more. Each temple is also connected through a vast underground network of tunnels.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/49fc94a812735c257be8191b4c6ed17a.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=352 /></span>Level up &gt; Learn new spells &gt; Grow crops &gt; Craft crops into magic potions &gt; Reactivate temples and restore balance to the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3009250?t=1746473649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746473649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746473649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746473649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/1bea0a81b180e7c3e943a43f416565ca.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=374 /></span><br><br>Garden Apocalypse is an Action/RPG with Tower Defense and Gardening elements. This epic adventure takes place on a strange alien desert world called &quot;Gardenia&quot;, fighting for resources and survival against a relentless army of mutant insects called The Swarm. Build structures, mine resources, and craft essential ammunition and magic potions required to conquer the Swarm Queen and restore balance to a dying world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/f07af6c3156397019377657e77a68775.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=351 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/8b2411fa60fac98fb2a4cb5738b9a28a.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=685 /></span>Choose from a wide variety of ranged and melee weapons to fight The Swarm and defend your crops. Enemies will drop key resources, depending on the weapon used to defeat them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/a86a33b8e8edfb38448fae2d7cb0f069.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=477 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardenians are your allies, who act as stationary defense towers. Destroy Swarm eggs before they hatch to acquire Swarm Stem Cells - a necessary component in crafting Gardenian seeds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/9cd53c4a5268e56f23b29537453add79.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft seeds by mining or crafting essential minerals. Once harvested, your crops can be used to replenish health or crafted into magic potions, required for casting spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/9995a0153f592f8f48f0e3dad440f77c.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=414 /></span>Magic spells are crucial to counter massive Swarm armies and unlock new areas as the player progresses. Only magic can defeat the &quot;Swarm Queens&quot;, making gardening an essential activity to craft potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/3e422b0fd06cd0f48be65d70f2a9f0d1.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic is required to unlock and reactivate several ancient temples across the world. These dungeons are full of large swarms, puzzles, loot and more. Each temple is also connected through a vast underground network of tunnels.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/extras/49fc94a812735c257be8191b4c6ed17a.avif?t=1746473649\" width=800 height=352 /></span>Level up &gt; Learn new spells &gt; Grow crops &gt; Craft crops into magic potions &gt; Reactivate temples and restore balance to the world.</p>","developers":["OMEGABYTE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"des