ets/steam/apps/3009250/ss_191136752a2f014a8e3bad2c9bbd52e8afd3164a.600x338.jpg?t=1746473649"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/ss_cb93f85fe63a2dfa8d39c396c9fffa82c4a4697e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746473649","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/ss_cb93f85fe63a2dfa8d39c396c9fffa82c4a4697e.600x338.jpg?t=1746473649"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/ss_3df2b16e671bbc2015b6ae7333b66af7ce0ebf7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746473649","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009250/ss_3df2b16e671bbc2015b6ae7333b66af7ce0ebf7b.600x338.jpg?t=1746473649"}],"short_description":"Once a thriving alien world, now a vast desert\u2014devoured by the relentless Swarm. These towering insect invaders have left only scattered oases and buried ruins. Grow food, craft powerful resources, and uncover lost secrets to push back against the tide and restore balance to a dying world.","steam_appid":3009250,"support_info":{"email":"breen3d@gmail.com","url":"https://omegamousegame.wixsite.com/omegabyte"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://omegamousegame.wixsite.com/omegabyte"}